# Walltop Sentries: "if there's a Lesson card in your graveyard" (CR 603.4, 205.3k) is about Bot1's own graveyard. Bot1's has no
# Lesson (a Lightning Bolt and its Entomb are no Lessons), and the one in Bot2's, put there by Bot2's Entomb, does not count: the
# Sentries die with no trigger on the stack and Bot1's life stays at 20.

